## Appendix A — Roadmap Toward STIX/TAXII Integration

The framework mappings in this report (MITRE ATT&CK technique IDs, IOC lists,
observed patterns) are structurally compatible with the STIX 2.1 data model.
A future iteration of this analyser could emit `Indicator`, `Observed-Data`, and
`Threat-Actor` STIX objects for consumption by an OpenCTI or MISP instance,
enabling correlation of this deployment's observations with wider industry
threat feeds. This work is deferred to a future development cycle.

